space" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0359em;">g</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">b</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span></span></span></span>.</li>
